                            when="1940-05-11T14:00:00-04:00">May 11, 1940—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>148. The Department is releasing to the press a statement as follows:</p>
                <p>[Here follows text printed in <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v02/pg_285"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, volume II,
                        page 285</ref>.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
